      "content": "Hey, I need a 5-day itinerary for an executive traveling through Southeast Asia next month. They need to hit Singapore, Bangkok, and Ho Chi Minh City for a series of back-to-back partner meetings. Can you put together a tight schedule that optimizes travel time between cities and includes business-class hotel suggestions and time for formal dinners?",
